Z||000000||Jaygee79||07-16-2001||11:34 AM||||We went to Kick Hill Saturday.  I got the radio and speedometer fascias (the ones with the black background and gray dots), a front emblem, a standard leather shift knob, and an automatic leather shift knob, all for $40. Bob didn't have the matching automatic fascia (or whatever it's called) so I'll have to find one of them somewhere else.  Anyone got one?<P>Just wanted to share my happiness  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jaime<BR>84SE red<BR>AOL IM: Jaygee79<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Jaygee79's Web Page</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pooh14.jpg"> ||||reg||10
