Z||000002||Kelvin Vivian||07-17-2001||11:20 PM||||Good stuff Jaygee... Picking through wrecked Fieros is a lot of fun, helps clear the mind...<P>I went to a Pick-n-Pull today to look for a right exhaust hanger for the exhaust tip on my 87 SE... Couldn't find one, but on my way out, I spotted a black 86 SE (its exhaust hangers were torn too  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">) but it still had its subwoofer system inside!<P>So I grabbed the speaker/subwoofer housing, the overhead console, a little aluminum amp box?, and it's plastic holder, and the wiring harness all for $45.00. I'll keep it as a spare for the one in the 87 SE. Or maybe I'll stick it in the GT...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><BR>Kelvin<BR>87 SE 4-cyl, burgundy/grey, 5-spd Isuzu<BR>88 GT T-top, bright red/beechwood, 5-spd Getrag||||reg||14
